  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation:**\n5 - 4 ÷ 2 × 10 + 7 = 7\n\nWe use the BODMAS rule to solve the equation:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nWe apply each option on the given equation and solve the equation:\n\nOption 1) 10 and 2\n\n**5 - 4 ÷ 2 × 10 + 7 = 7**\n\n5 - __**4 ÷ 10**__ × 5 + 7 = 7\n\n5 - __**0.4 × 5**__ + 7 = 7\n\n__**5**__ - 2 __**+ 7**__ = 7 \n\n__**12 - 2**__ = 7\n\n10 ≠ 7\n\nOption 2) 5 and 7 \n\n5 - 4 ÷ 2 × 10 + 7 = 7\n\n7 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ × 10 + 5 = 7\n\n7 - __2____** × 10**__ + 5 = 7\n\n__**7**__ - 20 __**+ 5**__ = 7\n\n__**12 - 20**__ = 7\n\n-8 ≠ 7 \n\nOption 3) 5 and 2\n\n5 - 4 ÷ 2 × 10 + 7 = 7\n\n2 - __**4 ÷ 5**__ × 10 + 7 = 7\n\n2 - __0.8__**__** × 10**__ + 7 = 7\n\n__**2**__ - 8 __**+ 7**__ = 7\n\n__**9 - 7**__ = 7\n\n2 ≠ 7 \n\nOption 5) 10 and 5\n\n5 - 4 ÷ 2 × 10 + 7 = 7\n\n10 - __**4 ÷ 2**__ × 5 + 7 = 7\n\n10 - __2____** × 5**__ + 7 = 7\n\n__**10**__ - 10 __**+ 7**__ = 7\n\n__**17 - 10**__ = 7\n\n7 = 7 \n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
